Z||000000||Slammed Fiero||06-13-2001||03:10 PM||||Ok , The tax man sent me some money this year.. <P>Was looking at speakers...nah..mine work fine , not really into stereo's.<P>Maybe Mr mikes leather seats...nooo... I want Sparco's..<P>NOS sounds like fun.<P>So I found a kit on Ebay , but the guy doesn't ship to canada. So I will have to buy new. What are some prices and places I can get a kit??<P>I plan to run a 60hp shot to begin with and see how that goes. The motor is original , has 40,000 miles on it. Change oil a lot due to autocrosses and track events. Runs great.  Clutch is new with less than 10,000 miles on it.<P>I have no cat so no worries about burning it up. I plan to use this occasionaly on the strip , and sometimes on the street for a little fun<P>Just want some pricing info , and any tips / pointers..I already searched it all out. OR!! if anyone has a used NOS kit they wanna sell, I will be glad to buy it today!!<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">      <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.<p>[This message has been edited by Slammed Fiero (edited 06-13-2001).]||||reg||1
