Z||000002||1FST2M6||06-13-2001||04:32 PM||||you want a nitrous express wet kit.. a TRUE 50 or 75 shot with 100 or 150lbft at the wheels...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <A HREF="http://www.nitrouswarehouse.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nitrouswarehouse.com</A>  and e-mail John Stewart or i can get you a kit through the shop Engineered is now a dealer for NX systems.. the NOS kits are ok but take some tunng o really appreciate the kit.. the wet is just plug and OH MY GOOOOOOOOD WHAT WAS I THINKING!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  LMAO.. heheh <P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg">       <BR>www.engineered.net<BR>www.enthuza.com||||reg||1
