Z||000017||1FST2M6||06-15-2001||11:08 AM||||for the nitrous set up? JUST the kit was $500 plus ignition $150, the intake and exhaust can stay stock... i made my own intake tube, and exhaust ( <A HREF="http://www.brullenexhaust.com" TARGET=_blank>www.brullenexhaust.com</A>  )<BR> <A HREF="http://www.nitrouswarehous.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nitrouswarehous.com</A>  for the nitrous kit or <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  you need part number 20216 ... nope not my own kit.. actuall i didn't pay for the kit.. i got it as a wedding present from the shops dyno tuner.  ||||reg||1
